      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T18:46:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "[`pw_log_tokenized_HandleLog()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/pw_log_zephyr_tokenized.cc;l\u003d88-133;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) acquires [`k_spin_lock(\u0026lock)`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/pw_log_zephyr_tokenized.cc;l\u003d108;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) before calling [`console_buf_notify_chars()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/pw_log_zephyr_tokenized.cc;l\u003d131-132;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745). Since [`k_spin_lock()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyrproject/zephyr/include/zephyr/spinlock.h;l\u003d194-228;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) masks CPU interrupts via [`arch_irq_lock()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyrproject/zephyr/include/zephyr/spinlock.h;l\u003d203;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745), `arch_cpu_irqs_are_enabled()` is false and [`k_can_yield()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/third_party/zephyrproject/zephyr/kernel/thread.c;l\u003d1897-1901;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) will always return false there.\n\nWith this change, 100% of tokenized logs on boards using `pw-tokenize` (`CONFIG_PIGWEED_LOG_TOKENIZED_LIB\u003dy`, e.g., `fatcat`, `trulo`, `atria`, `dougie`) will be dropped from `console_buf` and counted as `dropped_logs_isr`. ([`test_pw_log_tokenized.cc`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/test/console/src/test_pw_log_tokenized.cc;l\u003d61-70;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) doesn\u0027t currently check [`uart_console_read_buffer()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/console_buffer.c;l\u003d286;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745), so CQ doesn\u0027t catch this.)",
