      "message": "Exporting `dropped_logs_isr` via `test_export_static` isn\u0027t needed here. Please follow the same pattern as [`test_buf_dropped_logs_isr`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/test/drivers/console_buffer/src/console_buffer.c;l\u003d125-168;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) above and [`test_buf_dropped_logs_mutex`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/test/drivers/console_buffer/src/console_buffer.c;l\u003d184-242;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) below by reading the buffer via [`uart_console_read_buffer_init()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/console_buffer.c;l\u003d173;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) / [`uart_console_read_buffer()`](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/zephyr/shim/src/console_buffer.c;l\u003d286;drc\u003d686b61c7c2fa3f6706c02a53762ba25f0bf69745) and parsing `\"Dropped %u logs (ISR: %u, Mutex: %u, Overflow: %u)\"`. That avoids exposing internal static state and also verifies end-to-end that no characters were written to `console_buf`.",
